  "conclusions": [
    "Priw8 tutorial covers modern ECL with TH17 examples, not TH18-specific verification.",
    "Priw8 transforms article is scoped to TH13-17 and says 18 records; our TH18 Ghidra comparison establishes 24.",
    "Current INS_18 is empty and inherits older descriptions; absence of overrides is not semantic equality.",
    "Online TH18 eclmap byte-matches the local eclmap checkout; it has names and global types, no !ins_signatures section.",
    "thtk source-format inheritance and parser grammar complement mnemonic mapfiles.",
    "ExpHP thpages centers on ANM and links to Priw8 for ECL; truth syntax is distinct and its inspected README exposes no ECL tool.",
    "MERLIN README lists TH16/17 support, useful as terminology reference rather than assumed TH18 dependency.",
    "Local thtk and th-re-data HEADs differ from observed remote HEAD; local existing Ghidra work is not silently re-imported or updated."
